# Copy to .env in the app dir (never committed) and restart the app.
#
# There is no shared password: accounts are per-person and live in users.json
# next to the app, created by redeeming an invite link. Mint the first one on
# the server with `lwcc invite --admin --for you@example.com`.

# Where invite links point. Only needed if the site answers on another host
# (a local instance, say) — the default is https://lwcc.lab980.com.
#SITE_URL=https://lwcc.lab980.com

# Parallel conversion workers (default: CPU cores - 1, capped at 4).
# Conversion is CPU-bound (OCR) — more workers than cores gains nothing.
#CONVERT_WORKERS=2
